    "answer": "to{} warm/heat",
    "mnemonic": "You know that the kanji <ja>温</ja> means <kanji>warm</kanji>, and this verb is related. It means <vocabulary>to heat something up</vocabulary> or <vocabulary>to warm something up</vocabulary>. It's all about you doing something to another object to make it hot, like putting it in the microwave. ",
